{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00344",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.7,
      "end_seconds": 4.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.76,
      "end_seconds": 8.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.33,
      "end_seconds": 17.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "Um, so... a mole that has changed. That's why I came. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.79,
      "end_seconds": 21.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.91,
      "end_seconds": 35.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.7,
      "text": "So, it's been six months, I'm fairly sure. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. Well, I had it bled once before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.17,
      "end_seconds": 38.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.36,
      "end_seconds": 60.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Okay, that's done. Let me check a few things. Any history of sunburn, pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.77,
      "end_seconds": 64.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.98,
      "end_seconds": 67.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.37,
      "end_seconds": 70.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.9,
      "end_seconds": 75.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.8,
      "end_seconds": 77.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.87,
      "end_seconds": 83.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.44,
      "end_seconds": 88.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.23,
      "end_seconds": 91.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.98,
      "end_seconds": 94.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.58,
      "end_seconds": 97.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.27,
      "end_seconds": 102.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "So, yes, penicillin, it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.83,
      "end_seconds": 106.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.74,
      "end_seconds": 108.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.99,
      "end_seconds": 126.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.52,
      "end_seconds": 129.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.46,
      "end_seconds": 135.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known acid reflux. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.95,
      "end_seconds": 139.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.12,
      "end_seconds": 140.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.74,
      "end_seconds": 155.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.59,
      "end_seconds": 160.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.84,
      "end_seconds": 176.61,
      "duration_seconds": 14.77,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.91,
      "end_seconds": 179.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.49,
      "end_seconds": 183.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.04,
      "end_seconds": 191.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.59,
      "end_seconds": 213.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.9 degrees, saturation 98 percent, respiratory rate 16, pulse 84, blood pressure 119 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.72,
      "end_seconds": 216.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.15,
      "end_seconds": 220.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.36,
      "end_seconds": 225.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Alright, I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.62,
      "end_seconds": 230.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "So, now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.32,
      "end_seconds": 249.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I can't feel any glands in the armpit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.39,
      "end_seconds": 276.37,
      "duration_seconds": 24.98,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with a pigmented lesion that needs to be looked at more closely at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.87,
      "end_seconds": 286.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a mole that has changed for six months, and no pain or history of sunburn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.93,
      "end_seconds": 289.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yes, you know, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.24,
      "end_seconds": 300.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a dermoscopy for changing mole. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'm going to order a skin biopsy, for changing mole."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.2,
      "end_seconds": 303.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Okay, you know, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.91,
      "end_seconds": 315.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "Please use sunscreen and cover up in the midday sun, and check your skin once a month. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.52,
      "end_seconds": 325.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "Mm. I'll also refer you to a dermatologist. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.44,
      "end_seconds": 329.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.72,
      "end_seconds": 339.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.68,
      "end_seconds": 345.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "So, um, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.69,
      "end_seconds": 350.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.79,
      "end_seconds": 355.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Well, nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.61,
      "end_seconds": 357.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}